Aim: Handle division by zero using try-catch.

Algorithm: Start
perform division in try
catch exception 
print message
stop.

Program:

class ExceptionDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            int x = 10 / 0;
            System.out.println(x);
        } catch (ArithmeticException e) {
            System.out.println("Cannot divide by zero");
        }
    }
}

Result: Cannot divide by zero

